WEBVTT

00:01:28.479 --> 00:01:31.540
Ndio mana watu 
hunichanganya mimi na GPS.

00:01:31.564 --> 00:01:35.438
(Kicheko)

00:01:36.034 --> 00:01:39.981
Hii inafanya mawasiliano kuwa changamoto,
labda kama unahitaji maelekezo.

00:01:40.005 --> 00:01:44.420
(kicheko)

00:01:44.444 --> 00:01:45.618
Asante.

00:01:45.642 --> 00:01:49.869
(Makofi)

00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:53.839
Miaka michache iliyopita,
nilipoanza kufanya mawasilisho,

00:01:53.863 --> 00:01:56.492
Nilikwenda kupigwa shoti za kichwa
kwa mara ya kwanza.

00:01:57.381 --> 00:02:00.124
Mpiga picha aliniambia nijiweke kichafu.